# P38 on WSL GtkBackend: focus the page, Tab to its only link, follow it, then wheel inside the frame -- actions/mac/P38-scroll-the-web-view.actions. The page exposes nothing to AT-SPI; the framed area starts below the text at y 202 in an 820x660 window, so (700,240) and (410,430) are estimates. Check them against the capture.
# Pass: Navigations reported rises by one (it read 1 before) with the IANA page in the frame, scrolled away from its top.
# P38(WSL):讓頁面取得焦點、Tab 到唯一的連結並開啟，再於框內捲動;座標依版面估計。通過:Navigations reported 加一，框內是捲動過的 IANA 頁面。
